Mission Brief&nbsp;

At Isar Aerospace, we are enabling affordable and flexible access to space. As Europe’s leading privately funded launch company, we are developing and operating launch vehicles that provide reliable access to orbit for commercial and institutional customers worldwide. &nbsp;

To support the continued development and operation of our launch systems, we are looking for a ( Senior) Flight Safety Engineer to take ownership of flight safety engineering activities across vehicle development, licensing, and launch operations. In this role, you will drive the flight safety framework for our launch vehicles and act as a key interface between engineering, regulatory authorities, and launch range partners. &nbsp;

As a (Senior) Flight Safety Engineer in the Mission and Launch operations team, you will work at the intersection of engineering, risk analysis and mission operations. In that frame, you will ensure that our launch systems meet the highest standards of safety, reliability, and regulatory compliance throughout the vehicle lifecycle.&nbsp;

